{"type":"message","id":"be6fb516","parentId":"6a8b12dd","timestamp":"2026-07-28T10:36:17.062Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-3E7M9Dq3SizDAeJtUXDfMK","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Hanyi Wang \\\"ROAR\\\" ICCV 2025 watermark affiliation university\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1219,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f6dff46a28caf5f6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nChang Ee-Chien's Home Page\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f6dff46a28caf5f6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~changec/pub.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f1790f243e40996\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nJialai Wang, Juncheng Lu, Jie Yang, Junjie Wang, Zeyu Gao, Chao Zhang, Zhenkai Liang, Ee-Chien Chang, Improving LLM-based Log Parsing by Learning from Errors in Reasoning Traces, ASE 2025. Hanyi Wang, Han Fang, Shi-Lin Wang, Ee-Chien Chang, ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking, ICCV 2025.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f1790f243e40996\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.comp.nus.edu.sg\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9d694ac8a9a78f4e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nICCV 2025 Open Access Repository\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9d694ac8a9a78f4e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/html/Wang_ROAR_Reducing_Inversion_Error_in_Generative_Image_Watermarking_ICCV_2025_paper.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2716bb2941c6dc7a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo tackle these issues, we introduce two novel components: A Regeneration-based Optimization (RO) mechanism, which incorporates an optimizable starting latent to minimize latent-domain errors; A Mixture of Experts (MoE)-based distortion-adaptive restoration (AR) network, which effectively recovers watermarked distributions from pixel-level distortions.Extensive experiments demonstrate that ROAR significantly reduces inversion errors and enhances watermark extraction robustness, thereby improving the reliability of generative image watermarking. ... @InProceedings{Wang_2025_ICCV, author = {Wang, Hanyi and Fang, Han and Wang, Shi-Lin and Chang, Ee-Chien}, title = {ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking}, booktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)}, month = {October}, year = {2025}, pages = {19742-19751} }\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2716bb2941c6dc7a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"openaccess.thecvf.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1cb38eca2664dc66\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nICCV 2025 Thursday 10/23 - The Computer Vision Foundation\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1cb38eca2664dc66\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/day/10/23\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"486a72bfa6de099a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking · Hanyi Wang · Han Fang · Shi-Lin Wang ·\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"486a72bfa6de099a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"iccv.thecvf.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86a64696a67324ce\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nICCV Poster ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86a64696a67324ce\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/poster/969\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0628f8ede83c2da8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo tackle these issues, we introduce two novel components: A \\\\textbf{Regeneration-based Optimization (RO)} mechanism, which incorporates an optimizable starting latent to minimize latent-domain errors; A Mixture of Experts (MoE)-based \\\\textbf{distortion-adaptive restoration (AR)} network, which effectively recovers watermarked distributions from pixel-level distortions.Extensive experiments demonstrate that ROAR significantly reduces inversion errors and enhances watermark extraction robustness, thereby improving the reliability of generative image watermarking.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0628f8ede83c2da8\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 22, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"iccv.thecvf.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dcc38e9bd834b7d0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOrals - ICCV 2025 - The Computer Vision Foundation\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dcc38e9bd834b7d0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/events/oral\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a7241ed75d2b6ef2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo tackle these issues, we introduce two novel components: A \\\\textbf{Regeneration-based Optimization (RO)} mechanism, which incorporates an optimizable starting latent to minimize latent-domain errors; A Mixture of Experts (MoE)-based \\\\textbf{distortion-adaptive restoration (AR)} network, which effectively recovers watermarked distributions from pixel-level distortions.Extensive experiments demonstrate that ROAR significantly reduces inversion errors and enhances watermark extraction robustness, thereby improving the reliability of generative image watermarking.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a7241ed75d2b6ef2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"iccv.thecvf.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Hanyi Wang \"ROAR\" ICCV 2025 watermark affiliation university","provider":"brave","count":5,"tookMs":1219,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"brave","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f6dff46a28caf5f6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nChang Ee-Chien's Home Page\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f6dff46a28caf5f6\">>>","url":"https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~changec/pub.html","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1f1790f243e40996\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nJialai Wang, Juncheng Lu, Jie Yang, Junjie Wang, Zeyu Gao, Chao Zhang, Zhenkai Liang, Ee-Chien Chang, Improving LLM-based Log Parsing by Learning from Errors in Reasoning Traces, ASE 2025. Hanyi Wang, Han Fang, Shi-Lin Wang, Ee-Chien Chang, ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking, ICCV 2025.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1f1790f243e40996\">>>","siteName":"www.comp.nus.edu.sg"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9d694ac8a9a78f4e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nICCV 2025 Open Access Repository\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9d694ac8a9a78f4e\">>>","url":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/html/Wang_ROAR_Reducing_Inversion_Error_in_Generative_Image_Watermarking_ICCV_2025_paper.html","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2716bb2941c6dc7a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo tackle these issues, we introduce two novel components: A Regeneration-based Optimization (RO) mechanism, which incorporates an optimizable starting latent to minimize latent-domain errors; A Mixture of Experts (MoE)-based distortion-adaptive restoration (AR) network, which effectively recovers watermarked distributions from pixel-level distortions.Extensive experiments demonstrate that ROAR significantly reduces inversion errors and enhances watermark extraction robustness, thereby improving the reliability of generative image watermarking. ... @InProceedings{Wang_2025_ICCV, author = {Wang, Hanyi and Fang, Han and Wang, Shi-Lin and Chang, Ee-Chien}, title = {ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking}, booktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)}, month = {October}, year = {2025}, pages = {19742-19751} }\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2716bb2941c6dc7a\">>>","siteName":"openaccess.thecvf.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1cb38eca2664dc66\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nICCV 2025 Thursday 10/23 - The Computer Vision Foundation\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1cb38eca2664dc66\">>>","url":"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/day/10/23","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"486a72bfa6de099a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking · Hanyi Wang · Han Fang · Shi-Lin Wang ·\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"486a72bfa6de099a\">>>","siteName":"iccv.thecvf.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"86a64696a67324ce\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nICCV Poster ROAR: Reducing Inversion Error in Generative Image Watermarking\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"86a64696a67324ce\">>>","url":"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/poster/969","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0628f8ede83c2da8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo tackle these issues, we introduce two novel components: A \\textbf{Regeneration-based Optimization (RO)} mechanism, which incorporates an optimizable starting latent to minimize latent-domain errors; A Mixture of Experts (MoE)-based \\textbf{distortion-adaptive restoration (AR)} network, which effectively recovers watermarked distributions from pixel-level distortions.Extensive experiments demonstrate that ROAR significantly reduces inversion errors and enhances watermark extraction robustness, thereby improving the reliability of generative image watermarking.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0628f8ede83c2da8\">>>","published":"October 22, 2025","siteName":"iccv.thecvf.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CO